  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "雖然很唐突，\n但我希望<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳能幫我找人。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96D671365F8855107A81FF0C000A4F4662115E0C671B00100003110000FF01014F6059B380FD5E6B6211627E4EBA300200100002011401B60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我在找一個與毒藻龍搭檔的\n馴龍師訓練家。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115728627E4E00500B82076BD285FB9F8D642D6A947684000A99B49F8D5E2B8A137DF45BB6300200100002011401B60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "高個子，綠頭髮。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9AD8500B5B50FF0C7DA0982D9AEE300200100002011401B60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "還有……應該是一身\n街頭格鬥系的狂野打扮。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "908467092026202661C98A72662F4E008EAB000A8857982D683C9B257CFB768472C291CE6253626E300200100002011401B60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳有認識的人符合這些特徵，\n請務必告訴我！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C00100003110000FF01014F6059B367098A8D8B5876844EBA7B26540890194E9B72795FB5FF0C000A8ACB52D95FC5544A8A346211FF0100100002011401B60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我希望<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳能幫我找到……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n與毒藻龍搭檔的\n馴龍師訓練家。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n高個子，綠頭髮。\n應該是一身街頭格鬥系的<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n狂野打扮。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115E0C671B00100003110000FF01014F6059B380FD5E6B6211627E52302026202600100001BE01000A82076BD285FB9F8D642D6A947684000A99B49F8D5E2B8A137DF45BB6300200100001BE01000A9AD8500B5B50FF0C7DA0982D9AEE3002000A61C98A72662F4E008EAB8857982D683C9B257CFB768400100001BE00000A72C291CE6253626E300200100002011401B60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "有何貴幹？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67094F558CB45E79FF1F00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "妳怎麼穿成那樣。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "59B3600E9EBC7A7F621090A36A23300200100002011401B60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我想穿什麼都行吧！\n妳這個人怎麼說話這麼直。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621160F37A7F4EC09EBC90FD884C5427FF01000A59B39019500B4EBA600E9EBC8AAA8A7190199EBC76F4300200100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "話說回來，\n好久不見了，瑪鬥莎。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8A718AAA56DE4F86FF0C000A597D4E454E0D898B4E86FF0C746A9B25838E300200100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "為了要戰勝妳，\n我鍛鍊了自己，也鍛鍊了寶可夢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "70BA4E868981623052DD59B3FF0C000A6211935B934A4E8681EA5DF1FF0C4E5F935B934A4E865BF653EF5922300200100002011401B60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "身為戰士，鍛鍊乃理所當然！\n比起那時，我也變得更強了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8EAB70BA623058EBFF0C935B934A4E437406624075767136FF01000A6BD48D7790A36642FF0C62114E5F8B8A5F9766F45F374E86300200100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嗯！\n我要戰勝妳，實現當時的約定！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55EFFF01000A62118981623052DD59B3FF0C5BE673FE7576664276847D045B9AFF0100100002011401B60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "春紫！有什麼有趣的事，\n請不要忘了讓我也一起玩玩吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1032,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "66257D2BFF0167094EC09EBC67098DA376844E8BFF0C000A8ACB4E0D89815FD84E868B9362114E5F4E008D7773A973A95427300200100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "什……？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1096,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4EC020262026FF1F00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "別妨礙我們的對戰！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "522559A879196211501176845C0D6230FF0100100002011401B60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "想和春紫戰鬥，\n是必須先得到我的同意的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "60F3548C66257D2B62309B25FF0C000A662F5FC5980851485F97523062117684540C610F7684300200100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "妳只有一個選項！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n那就是和<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȂ先生小姐搭檔，\n與我們對戰！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "59B353EA67094E00500B90789805FF0100100001BE01000A90A35C31662F548C001000020100000000100003110000FF02025148751F5C0F59D0642D6A94FF0C000A8207621150115C0D6230FF0100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "引導大家是我們名流的責任，\n皮可西！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F155C0E59275BB6662F62115011540D6D4176848CAC4EFBFF0C000A76AE53EF897FFF0100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "該拿出我們的絕招了！\n毒藻龍！超級進化然後大幹一場吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8A7262FF51FA6211501176847D5562DB4E86FF01000A6BD285FB9F8DFF018D857D1A9032531671365F8C59275E794E0058345427FF0100100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "妳說妳這段期間都在鍛鍊自己，\n那句話並沒有騙人。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "59B38AAA59B390196BB5671F959390FD5728935B934A81EA5DF1FF0C000A90A353E58A714E266C9267099A194EBA300200100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那當然！但這次的勝利\n都要歸功於<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A375767136FF014F4690196B21768452DD5229000A90FD89816B78529F65BC0010000201000000300200100002011401B60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不過，勝利就是勝利。\n妳得要遵守當時的約定。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D904EFF0C52DD52295C31662F52DD52293002000A59B35F97898190755B887576664276847D045B9A300200100002011401B60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "春紫，\n成為我的搭檔吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "66257D2BFF0C000A621070BA62117684642D6A945427FF0100100002011401B60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "關於那件事……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "95DC65BC90A34EF64E8B2026202600100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我已經有認定的搭檔了。\n對不起，我沒辦法守住約定……！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1648,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115DF27D9367098A8D5B9A7684642D6A944E863002000A5C0D4E0D8D77FF0C62116C928FA66CD55B884F4F7D045B9A20262026FF0100100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "妳明明就和沐淨搭檔過……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "59B3660E660E5C31548C6C906DE8642D6A94904E2026202600100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我都說過了那是……\n因為安馨兒小姐的關係。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621190FD8AAA904E4E8690A3662F20262026000A56E070BA5B8999A851525C0F59D0768495DC4FC2300200100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "原來……\n是我鍛鍊得太久，錯過了再戰的時機了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "539F4F8620262026000A662F6211935B934A5F97592A4E45FF0C932F904E4E86518D6230768466426A5F4E86300200100002011401B60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我知道了。\n春紫……妳那身打扮也挺不賴的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621177E590534E863002000A66257D2B2026202659B390A38EAB6253626E4E5F633A4E0D8CF47684300200100002011401B60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n也要謝謝<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳幫了我不少喔！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 1908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C000A4E5F89818B1D8B1D00100003110000FF01014F6059B35E6B4E8662114E0D5C115594FF0100100002011401B60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "唉～呀，\n在哪裡能遇見個好搭檔呢？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 1968,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5509FF5E5440FF0C000A572854EA88E180FD9047898B500B597D642D6A945462FF1F00100002011401B60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿#",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00230000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "就像是常在戰場，\n搭檔最好是個隨時都能彼此對戰，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n而且又能彼此信賴的人。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C3150CF662F5E38572862305834FF0C000A642D6A946700597D662F500B96A8664290FD80FD5F7C6B645C0D6230FF0C00100001BE00000A800C4E1453C880FD5F7C6B644FE18CF476844EBA300200100002011401B60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    }
